   134	All reads on Sol (gpt-5.6-sol): editorial, cold read, source-distance (4 tracked passages, no dense scene; probe 1% / 4%), plan / canon / protected-text audit (RATIFY WITH LINE FIXES — fourteen applied by the coordinator, including the four protected units the author had left as markers and the cord's length). The audit also settled five conflicts between Book 8's plan and the locked Book 7 (the spear; Teague reading; Lira's asking; the stroke and bar; the cord), all resolved in the plan, not in Book 7. Same-author repair r1 in progress when this block was written; the CLOSED note follows when the recheck returns.
